# Affiliate IDs

**Never** put affiliate IDs, tags, or campids in this extension repo.

- **Source of truth**: website `src/content/affiliate-partners.json`
- **Public feed** (extension fetches): `https://rechnerlotsen.com/data/affiliate-partners.json` — hosts, labels, param **names** only
- **Fallback** (`src/partners-fallback.ts`): hosts/labels/param names only — no IDs
- Tagging happens on the website support page via `applyAffiliateTag` in `src/lib/affiliate-partners.ts`

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — ID in extension
url.searchParams.set('tag', 'rechnerlotsen-21')

// ✅ GOOD — redirect to support; website adds the ID
buildSupportUrl(dest, partnerKey) // → rechnerlotsen.com/support?dest=…&partner=…
```
